# MuktPay mobile: environment variables (copy to .env for local use; never commit .env)
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_* values are baked into the app at build time.
#
# Development: leave this unset. The app finds your computer on the local network
# (http://<your-LAN-IP>:4000/api) automatically.
#
# Release / production builds: REQUIRED. Must be https, must end with /api, and must not
# point at localhost or a private network address. For EAS builds, set it in eas.json or as
# an EAS environment variable instead of this file.
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.your-domain.com/api
